<zk>
	<label multiline="true">
		1. Open this page in Chrome 155 or later with the DevTools console open.
		Expected: no "Permissions policy violation: unload is not allowed in this document" error.
		Bug (ZK-6287): golden-layout binds a window unload listener, which Chrome reports as that error.
		2. Click "detach". Expected: no error, and the goldenlayout is gone.
	</label>
	<goldenlayout id="gl" height="300px">
		<goldenpanel title="Panel A">A</goldenpanel>
		<goldenpanel title="Panel B">B</goldenpanel>
	</goldenlayout>
	<button id="detach" label="detach" onClick="gl.detach()"/>
</zk>
